-- title:
--   All zeros of ζ with 121 ≤ Im ρ ≤ 1000000 lie on the critical line
-- statement:
--   Every zero $\rho$ of the Riemann zeta function with $121\le\operatorname{Im}\rho\le10^6$ lies on the critical line:
--
--   $$
--   \zeta(\rho)=0,\ 0<\operatorname{Im}\rho,\ 121\le\operatorname{Im}\rho\le10^6\ \Longrightarrow\ \operatorname{Re}\rho=\tfrac12 .
--   $$
